                distractors: ["Pronator Quadratus", "Flexor Carpi Radialis", "Brachioradialis"],
                concept: "Pronator teres forms the medial border of the cubital fossa, arising from the medial epicondyle and coronoid process to insert onto the lateral radius mid-shaft. It is innervated by the median nerve.",
